<title>USA: Comcast Corp Q4 and year earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Comcast Corp Q4 and year earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA, Pa. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.10	  loss    $0.03</p>
